msgid ""
"**`Ascend language extension`**   在标准 Triton 语言基础上，引入针对 Ascend NPU "
"架构的语法与语义扩展。"
msgstr ""
"**`Ascend language extension`**    Syntax and semantic extensions for the "
"Ascend NPU architecture areintroduced based on the standard Triton language."


msgid ""
"**`compiler`**   接收来自上层 Triton compiler 生成的中间表示文件 `TTIR`（Triton "
