"Triton IR 转换为 Linalg IR，再经 BiSheng Compiler 生成面向 Ascend NPU 的可执行二进制文件  "
"`triton_xxx_kernel.o`。"
msgstr ""
"  Converts the Triton IR into the Linalg IR, and then generates "
"theexecutable binary file `triton_xxx_kernel.o` for the Ascend NPU "
"throughthe BiSheng Compiler."


msgid ""
"**`driver`**   提供 Triton 运行时与 Ascend 软件栈（CANN）之间的对接能力， 加载由 BiSheng Compiler "
"生成的设备侧可执行内核 `triton_xxx_kernel.o` 。"
msgstr ""
"**`driver`**    Provides the interconnection capability between the Triton"
" runtime andthe Ascend software stack (CANN), and loads the executable "
"kernel file`triton_xxx_kernel.o` generated by the BiSheng Compiler on the "
"deviceside."


