msgid "triton-to-annotation"
msgstr "triton-to-annotation"


msgid ""
"处理Ascend NPU特有的编译提示指令 "
"(`tl.compile_hint`)，将其转换为后端的Annotation方言，用于指导后续的硬件特定优化或资源配置。"
msgstr ""
"Processes Ascend NPU-specific compilation hint instructions "
"(`tl.compile_hint`), converting them into the backend Annotation dialect to "
"guide subsequent hardware-specific optimization or resource configuration."


msgid "TritonAnnotationConversion"
msgstr "TritonAnnotationConversion"


msgid ""
"将 `triton::AnnotationOp` 转换为 `annotation::MarkOp`，实现高级编译提示信息向底层注释标记的传递。"
msgstr ""
"Converts `triton::AnnotationOp` to `annotation::MarkOp`, enabling the "
"transfer of high-level compilation hints to underlying annotation markers."


msgid "triton-to-hfusion"
msgstr "triton-to-hfusion"


msgid "将Triton中的`TTIR`转换为Ascend NPU硬件加速器`HFusion`方言中的对应操作"
msgstr ""
"Converts `TTIR` in Triton to corresponding operations in the Ascend NPU "
"hardware accelerator `HFusion` dialect."


msgid "TritonHistogramToHFusionConversion"
msgstr "TritonHistogramToHFusionConversion"


msgid "将 `triton::HistogramOp` 转换为 `hfusion::HistogramOp`，使能在NPU的专用硬件上高效执行。"
msgstr ""
"Converts `triton::HistogramOp` to `hfusion::HistogramOp`, enabling efficient"
" execution on dedicated NPU hardware."


msgid "triton-to-hivm"
msgstr "triton-to-hivm"


msgid ""
"处理Triton的块同步操作 (`tl.sync_block_all`, `tl.sync_block_set`, "
"`tl.sync_block_wait`)，将其转换为Ascend "
"NPU的`HIVM`方言中的跨核心同步指令。这些指令用于管理多核流水线中的同步与数据依赖，是流水优化的关键。"
msgstr ""
"Processes Triton's block synchronization operations (`tl.sync_block_all`, "
"`tl.sync_block_set`, `tl.sync_block_wait`), converting them into cross-core "
"synchronization instructions in the Ascend NPU `HIVM` dialect. These "
"instructions manage synchronization and data dependencies in multi-core "
"pipelines and are key to pipeline optimization."


msgid "TritonCustomOpToHIVMSyncOpConversion"
msgstr "TritonCustomOpToHIVMSyncOpConversion"


msgid ""
"实现Triton同步指令到HIVM同步指令的转换：<br>• `sync_block_all`：全局块同步<br>• "
"`sync_block_set`：设置同步点<br>• `sync_block_wait`：等待同步点"
msgstr ""
"Converts Triton synchronization instructions to HIVM synchronization "
"instructions:<br>• `sync_block_all`: Global block synchronization<br>• "
"`sync_block_set`: Set synchronization point<br>• `sync_block_wait`: Wait for"
" synchronization point"


msgid "triton-to-llvm"
msgstr "triton-to-llvm"


msgid ""
"将Triton中的内联汇编操作 (`tl.inline_assembly`) 转换为LLVM方言的内联汇编，并最终映射为Ascend "
"NPU的CCE硬件固有函数（Intrinsics）"
msgstr ""
"Converts Triton's inline assembly operations (`tl.inline_assembly`) to LLVM "
"dialect inline assembly, ultimately mapping to Ascend NPU CCE hardware "
"intrinsics."


msgid "ElementwiseInlineAsmOpConversion"
msgstr "ElementwiseInlineAsmOpConversion"


