msgstr "3.2.3 Ascend affinitive Operators"


msgid "Operator"
msgstr "Operator"


msgid "tl.custom_op"
msgstr "tl.custom_op"


msgid ""
"Ascend NPU扩展的自定义算子集，用于支持硬件特定的内存访问与数据搬运模式，例如：<br>• `index_select`: "
"基于索引选择数据<br>• `index_put`: 基于索引放置数据<br>• `gather_out_to_ub`: 将外部数据收集到Unified"
" Buffer (UB)<br>• `scatter_ub_to_out`: 将UB中的数据分散输出<br>• `indirect_load`: "
"间接地址加载<br>• `indirect_store`: 间接地址存储"
msgstr ""
"A custom operator set extended for Ascend NPU to support hardware-specific "
"memory access and data movement patterns, such as:<br>• `index_select`: "
"Select data based on index<br>• `index_put`: Place data based on index<br>• "
"`gather_out_to_ub`: Gather external data to Unified Buffer (UB)<br>• "
"`scatter_ub_to_out`: Scatter data from UB to output<br>• `indirect_load`: "
"Indirect address loading<br>• `indirect_store`: Indirect address storage"


msgid "tl.compile_hint"
msgstr "tl.compile_hint"


msgid "向编译器传递硬件特定的编译提示信息，用于指导后端优化策略、资源分配或内核配置。"
msgstr ""
"Passes hardware-specific compilation hints to the compiler to guide backend "
"optimization strategies, resource allocation, or kernel configuration."


msgid "tl.sync_block_wait(`sender, receiver, event_id`)"
msgstr "tl.sync_block_wait(`sender, receiver, event_id`)"


msgid ""
"块同步等待操作。指定接收核 (`receiver`) 等待由发送核 (`sender`) 发出的事件信号 "
"(`event_id`)，用于管理跨核流水线中的数据依赖与执行顺序。"
msgstr ""
"Block synchronization wait operation. Specifies that the receiver core "
"(`receiver`) waits for the event signal (`event_id`) sent by the sender core"
" (`sender`), used to manage data dependencies and execution order in cross-"
"core pipelines."


msgid "tl.sync_block_set(`sender, receiver, event_id`)"
msgstr "tl.sync_block_set(`sender, receiver, event_id`)"


msgid ""
"块同步设置操作。指定发送核 (`sender`) 向接收核 (`receiver`) 发出一个事件信号 "
"(`event_id`)，表明某个执行阶段或数据已准备就绪。"
msgstr ""
"Block synchronization set operation. Specifies that the sender core "
"(`sender`) sends an event signal (`event_id`) to the receiver core "
"(`receiver`), indicating that a certain execution phase or data is ready."


msgid "tl.sync_block_all(`mode, event_id`)"
msgstr "tl.sync_block_all(`mode, event_id`)"


msgid ""
"全局块同步操作。根据指定的同步模式 (`mode`)，向所有相关的接收核广播一个事件信号 "
"(`event_id`)，用于实现全核同步或特定模式的集体同步。"
msgstr ""
"Global block synchronization operation. Broadcasts an event signal "
"(`event_id`) to all relevant receiver cores according to the specified "
"synchronization mode (`mode`), used to achieve full-core synchronization or "
"mode-specific collective synchronization."

msgid "Triton-Ascend autotune 使用指南"
msgstr "Triton-Ascend Autotune Guide"


msgid "文档定位"
msgstr "Positioning"


msgid ""
"本文面向已经会写 Triton kernel、也了解社区版 `triton.autotune` 基本概念的用户，重点说明 Triton-"
"Ascend 的推荐用法："
msgstr ""
"This guide is intended for users who already know how to write Triton"
"kernels and already understand the basic concepts of community"
"`triton.autotune`. It focuses on the recommended Triton-Ascend usage:"


msgid "Triton-Ascend 上的推荐 autotune 写法；"
msgstr "the recommended autotune usage on Triton-Ascend;"


msgid "`configs=[]` 在 Ascend 后端中的含义；"
msgstr "what `configs=[]` means on the Ascend backend;"


msgid "自动 Tiling 模式的适用边界，以及何时回到手写 `triton.Config`。"
msgstr ""
"when automatic tiling is a good fit, and when you should fall back to"
"handwritten `triton.Config`."


msgid "快速上手"
msgstr "Recommended Usage"


msgid ""
"在 Triton-Ascend 上，推荐保留社区版 `@triton.autotune` 的基本写法；当希望系统自动生成并评估候选配置时，将 "
"`configs` 设为 `[]`："
msgstr ""
"On Triton-Ascend, the recommended usage is to keep the community-style"
"`@triton.autotune` interface and set `configs=[]` when you want the"
"backend to generate and evaluate candidate configurations automatically:"


msgid "这表示："
msgstr "This means:"


msgid "`key` 的语义与社区版保持一致，用于决定哪些输入变化会触发重新选择配置；"
msgstr ""
"`key` has the same semantics as in community Triton and determines"
"which runtime-input changes trigger re-selection of a configuration;"


msgid ""
"`configs=[]` 在 Triton-Ascend 中表示“由 Ascend backend "
"自动生成候选配置并完成寻优”，而不是“没有可选配置”。"
msgstr ""
"`configs=[]` on Triton-Ascend means \"
msgid "1. 先启用 Ascend 对 autotune 的扩展"
msgstr "1. Enable Ascend's extension for autotune first"


msgid "只有导入下面这行后，才会进入 Triton-Ascend 的 autotune 扩展路径："
msgstr ""
"Only after importing the following line will Triton-Ascend enter the"
"autotune extension path:"


msgid ""
"如果没有这一步，使用的仍然是社区版 `triton.autotune`，`configs=[]` 也不会触发 Ascend 的自动 Tiling "
"生成。"
msgstr ""
"Without this step, you are still using the community `triton.autotune`,"
"and `configs=[]` does not trigger Ascend automatic tiling."


msgid "2. `@triton.autotune` 必须直接包在 `@triton.jit` 外层"
msgstr "2. `@triton.autotune` must wrap `@triton.jit` directly"


msgid "必须写成下面这种顺序："
msgstr "It must be written in the following order:"


msgid ""
"`@triton.autotune` 必须直接包在 `@triton.jit` 外层，不能在两者之间插入其他 decorator。否则会导致无法对"
" kernel DSL 进行解析，从而无法进入 Triton-Ascend 的自动 Tiling 生成与寻优链路。"
msgstr ""
"`@triton.autotune` must wrap `@triton.jit` directly, and no other"
"decorator should be inserted between them. Otherwise, the kernel DSL may"
"not be parsed correctly, and Triton-Ascend may fail to enter the"
"automatic-tiling generation and tuning path."


msgid "3. `key` 的含义与社区一致"
msgstr "3. `key` has the same meaning as in community Triton"


msgid "`key` 的本质是 autotune 的 cache key。凡是填入 `key` 的参数，只要取值发生变化，就会触发重新 autotune。"
msgstr ""
"`key` is effectively the autotune cache key. Any parameter included in"
"`key` triggers autotune again when its value changes."


msgid ""
"大多数情况下，`key` 里放的是 `M/N/K`、`seq_len`、`hidden_size` 这类 shape "
"参数，因为它们往往会显著影响最优 Tiling；但 `key` 并不只限于 shape 参数，只要某个参数变化会影响配置选择，也可以放入 "
"`key`。"
msgstr ""
"In most cases, `key` contains shape parameters such as `M/N/K`,"
"`seq_len`, or `hidden_size`, because they often have a significant"
"impact on the optimal tiling choice. However, `key` is not limited to"
"shape parameters. If another parameter affects configuration selection,"
"it can also be included."


msgid "4. 希望参与自动调优的参数不要被提前固定"
msgstr ""
"4. Do not fix parameters that should participate in automatic tuning"
"too early"


msgid "如果希望某个 `tl.constexpr` 参与自动 Tiling 生成，需要同时满足下面三点："
msgstr ""
"If you want a `tl.constexpr` parameter to participate in automatic"
"tiling generation, all of the following must be true:"


msgid "它本身必须是 Tiling 参数，也就是会影响每个 block（逻辑核）处理的数据规模或 tile 大小的参数；"
msgstr ""
"it must be a tiling parameter, meaning that it affects how much data"
"each block processes or how tile sizes are formed;"


msgid "不要在 launch 时把它显式传值写死；"
msgstr "it must not be fixed explicitly in the launch call;"


msgid "不要在 kernel 定义里给它设置默认值。"
msgstr "it must not have a default value in the kernel definition."


msgid "例如下面这种写法，`BLOCK_M` 会参与自动调优："
msgstr ""
"For example, in the following code, `BLOCK_M` participates in automatic"
"tuning:"


msgid "如果你在 launch 时显式传入："
msgstr "If you explicitly pass:"


msgid "那这个参数就已经被固定，不再属于自动生成范围。"
msgstr ""
"then the parameter is already fixed and is no longer part of the"
"automatic-generation space."


msgid "同样，如果在 kernel 定义中给某个调优参数提供了默认值，例如："
msgstr ""
"Likewise, if a tunable parameter is given a default value in the kernel"
"definition, for example:"


msgid ""
"那么这个参数也不会参与自动调优。对于希望交给框架自动生成和寻优的参数，应该把它保留为“未在 launch 时显式传值、且在 kernel "
"定义中也没有默认值”的 `tl.constexpr`。"
msgstr ""
"then the parameter does not participate in automatic tuning. For"
"parameters that should be generated and tuned automatically by the"
"framework, keep them as `tl.constexpr` parameters that are neither"
"passed explicitly at launch time nor given default values in the kernel"
"definition."


msgid "5. 如果 Tiling 参数会影响 grid，grid 必须写成 lambda 形式"
msgstr ""
"5. If a tiling parameter affects the grid, the grid must be written"
"as a lambda"


msgid ""
"如果某个 Tiling 参数会影响 grid 大小，那么 grid 不能提前写成固定值或只依赖运行时参数的静态表达式，而必须写成依赖 meta "
"参数的 `lambda` 形式。这一点与社区 autotune 的要求一致。"
msgstr ""
"If a tiling parameter affects the grid size, the grid must not be"
"written as a fixed value or a static expression that depends only on"
"runtime parameters. Instead, it must be written as a `lambda` that"
"depends on meta parameters, just as in community autotune."


msgid ""
"原因是 autotune 在评估不同候选配置时，`BLOCK_M` 这类参数的取值会变化；如果 grid "
"不随候选配置一起变化，就无法保证每个候选配置都以正确的发射方式执行。"
msgstr ""
"The reason is that when autotune evaluates different candidate"
"configurations, parameters such as `BLOCK_M` change. If the grid does"
"not change with the candidate configuration, Triton-Ascend cannot"
"guarantee that each candidate is launched correctly."


msgid "使用注意事项"
msgstr "Practical Notes"


msgid ""
"autotune 的 benchmark 语义与社区一致，会多次执行 kernel。如果 kernel "
"存在副作用，例如包含原子操作、inplace 写入，或会修改输入/输出 buffer 的累积状态，仍然需要通过社区已有的 hook 机制处理。"
msgstr ""
"The benchmark semantics are the same as in community autotune: the"
"kernel may be executed multiple times. If the kernel has side effects,"
"such as atomic operations, in-place writes, or accumulated modifications"
"to input or output buffers, the existing community hook mechanism is"
"still required."


msgid "Triton-Ascend 相比社区 autotune 的扩展"
msgstr "What Triton-Ascend Adds Beyond Community Autotune"


msgid ""
"社区版 `triton.autotune` 的典型模式是：用户手工提供一组 `triton.Config`，框架做 "
"benchmark，然后缓存最优结果。"
msgstr ""
"The typical community `triton.autotune` workflow is that the user"
"provides a set of handwritten `triton.Config` objects, the framework"
"benchmarks them, and the best result is cached."


msgid "Triton-Ascend 在保持这套接口习惯不变的前提下，主要扩展了下面几件事。"
msgstr ""
"Triton-Ascend keeps the same usage style but extends it in several"
"important ways."


msgid "1. 支持 `configs=[]` 自动生成候选配置"
msgstr ""
"1. Support for `configs=[]` to generate candidate configurations"
"automatically"


msgid ""
"这是最核心的扩展。用户不必先手写一组 `triton.Config`，而是可以把 `configs` 留空，让 Ascend backend 根据"
" kernel DSL 语义和运行时 shape 自动生成候选配置。"
msgstr ""
"This is the core extension. Users do not have to handwrite a list of"
"`triton.Config` objects up front. Instead, they can leave `configs`"
"empty and let the Ascend backend generate candidate configurations from"
"the kernel DSL semantics and runtime shapes."


msgid "2. 支持多个 config 的并行编译"
msgstr "2. Parallel compilation of multiple candidates"


msgid "当 autotune 需要评估多个候选配置时，Triton-Ascend 默认会并行编译这些候选配置，以缩短首次调优时延。"
msgstr ""
"When autotune needs to evaluate multiple candidate configurations,"
"Triton-Ascend compiles them in parallel by default to reduce first-tune"
"latency."


msgid "这一能力默认开启，可通过环境变量 `TRITON_AUTOTUNE_PARALLEL_COMPILE=0` 关闭。"
msgstr ""
"This behavior is enabled by default and can be disabled with"
"`TRITON_AUTOTUNE_PARALLEL_COMPILE=0`."


msgid "3. 支持使用 profiler 采集 kernel 性能"
msgstr "3. Support for profiler-based performance collection"


msgid ""
"Triton-Ascend 支持在 autotune 做 benchmark 时切换性能采集方式：除了默认 benchmark 模式外，还可以使用"
" profiler 来采集每个候选 config 的 kernel 性能数据，它只关注 kernel 的片上计算时间，对于执行时间较短的 "
"kernel 比默认性能采集方式更加精确，但会增加一些耗时。这项能力可通过环境变量 `TRITON_BENCH_METHOD='npu'` 开启。"
msgstr ""
"Triton-Ascend supports switching the performance-collection method used"
"during autotune benchmark. In addition to the default benchmark path,"
"you can use profiler-based collection for each candidate configuration."
"This path focuses on on-chip execution time and is more accurate than"
"the default method for short-running kernels, but it also increases"
"autotune time. This feature can be enabled by setting"
"`TRITON_BENCH_METHOD=\"
msgid "自动 Tiling 生成能力的范围与行为"
msgstr "Scope and Behavior of Automatic Tiling Generation"


msgid "前面的第 1 点说明了 Triton-Ascend 支持 `configs=[]` 自动生成候选配置。对这项能力，进行以下几点说明。"
msgstr ""
"The first extension above shows that Triton-Ascend supports automatic"
"generation of candidate configurations with `configs=[]`. The following"
"points further clarify the behavior of this capability."


msgid "1. 自动生成范围聚焦在 Tiling 参数"
msgstr "1. Automatic generation focuses on tiling parameters"


msgid ""
"Ascend 自动生成的重点是 kernel 中与 Tiling 相关的 `tl.constexpr` 参数，也就是影响每个 "
"block（逻辑核）处理的数据规模或 tile 大小的参数。"
msgstr ""
"Automatic generation in Ascend focuses on tiling-related `tl.constexpr`"
"parameters, that is, parameters that affect how much data each block"
"processes or how tile sizes are formed."


msgid ""
"这套能力不等价于“自动帮你调所有参数”。像 `num_warps`、`num_stages` 这类编译参数，以及 kernel 的非 Tiling"
" 参数，不属于当前自动生成范围。"
msgstr ""
"This capability does not mean \"
msgid "2. 候选配置会带上 Ascend 硬件约束"
msgstr ""
"2. Candidate configurations are filtered with Ascend hardware"
"constraints"


msgid ""
"Ascend backend 在生成候选时，会结合 NPU 的片上存储容量、对齐约束、核数利用等边界做筛选，而不是单纯枚举一批配置再盲目 "
"benchmark。"
msgstr ""
"When generating candidates, the Ascend backend filters them using"
"NPU-specific constraints such as on-chip memory capacity, alignment"
"constraints, and core-utilization limits, instead of simply enumerating"
"many configurations and benchmarking them blindly."


msgid "3. 自动 Tiling 模式的目标是方便给出“性能不错”的配置"
msgstr ""
"3. The goal of automatic tiling is to provide a reasonably good"
"configuration"


msgid "为了权衡寻优时间和寻优效果，当前自动 Tiling 会对生成配置数量做大量剪枝，因此并不保证自动生成结果一定能达到手工极致调优的性能上限。"
msgstr ""
"To balance tuning cost and tuning result quality, current automatic"
"tiling prunes the candidate space heavily. As a result, the"
"automatically generated result is not guaranteed to reach the upper"
"bound of carefully hand-tuned performance."


msgid "这项能力的目标，是在尽量降低用户使用门槛和寻优成本的前提下，方便地给用户提供一个性能还不错的 Tiling 配置。"
msgstr ""
"The goal of this feature is to lower the usage barrier and tuning cost"
"while making it easy to obtain a configuration with reasonably good"
"performance."


msgid "4. 自动 Tiling 生成失败时需要用户手写 `triton.Config`"
msgstr ""
"4. When automatic tiling fails, users need handwritten"
"`triton.Config`"


msgid ""
"如果自动 Tiling 模式无法生成任何可用候选配置，这时需要用户改为手写 `triton.Config`。同时也建议对这类场景提 "
"issue，帮助 Triton-Ascend 后续补齐解析和自动生成能力。"
msgstr ""
"If automatic tiling cannot generate any valid candidate configurations,"
"you need to switch back to handwritten `triton.Config`. It is also"
"recommended to file an issue for such cases so that Triton-Ascend can"
"improve parsing and automatic-generation coverage later."


msgid "手写 `triton.Config` 模式"
msgstr "Handwritten `triton.Config` Mode"


msgid ""
"如果自动 Tiling 模式生成失败，或生成的 Tiling 性能未达到预期，直接回到社区标准写法即可。Triton-Ascend "
"对这部分语义保持兼容："
msgstr ""
"If automatic tiling fails, or if the generated tiling result does not"
"meet your performance target, you can return directly to the standard"
"community-style handwritten configuration path. Triton-Ascend keeps this"
"part of the interface compatible:"


msgid "这一模式下："
msgstr "In this mode:"


msgid "配置由用户手工提供；"
msgstr "configurations are defined explicitly by the user;"


msgid "框架负责 benchmark、选择最优配置和缓存复用；"
msgstr ""
"the framework still handles benchmarking, best-config selection, and"
"cache reuse;"


msgid "使用习惯与社区 autotune 保持一致。"
msgstr "the usage pattern remains consistent with community Triton autotune."


msgid "进阶用法：自动 Tiling 与其他参数联合调优"
msgstr ""
"Advanced Usage: Combine Automatic Tiling with Other Tunable"
"Parameters"


msgid "以下内容属于进阶用法，只有当用户希望在自动 Tiling 模式下，继续联合调优 kernel 的非 Tiling 参数或编译参数时，再考虑使用。"
msgstr ""
"The following content is advanced usage and should only be considered"
"when you want to continue tuning non-tiling kernel parameters or"
"compilation parameters together with automatic tiling."


msgid "1. 社区 autotune：手工枚举全部调优参数"
msgstr "1. Community autotune: enumerate all tunable parameters manually"


msgid "社区标准写法是由用户手工枚举所有候选配置："
msgstr ""
"In the standard community style, users enumerate all candidate"
"configurations manually:"


msgid "2. Triton-Ascend：手工枚举 Tiling 参数和 Ascend 编译参数"
msgstr ""
"2. Triton-Ascend: enumerate tiling parameters and Ascend compilation"
"parameters manually"


msgid "在 Triton-Ascend 中，如果希望继续走手工枚举模式，也可以把 Ascend 侧参数一起放进手工配置空间："
msgstr ""
"In Triton-Ascend, if you still want to use manual enumeration, you can"
"also put Ascend-side parameters into the handwritten configuration"
"space:"


msgid "3. Triton-Ascend：自动生成 Tiling，同时联合调优其他参数"
msgstr ""
"3. Triton-Ascend: generate tiling automatically while tuning other"
"parameters jointly"


msgid ""
"如果希望 Tiling 参数继续由 `configs=[]` 自动生成，但又希望同时调优其他非 Tiling "
"参数或编译参数，可以把这些额外搜索维度通过 `hints` 传入："
msgstr ""
"If you want tiling parameters to continue being generated automatically"
"through `configs=[]`, but also want to tune additional non-tiling"
"parameters or compilation parameters, you can pass those extra search"
"dimensions through `hints`:"


msgid "这种方式的含义是："
msgstr "This means:"


msgid "Tiling 相关参数仍然由 Triton-Ascend 自动生成；"
msgstr ""
"tiling-related parameters are still generated automatically by"
"Triton-Ascend;"


msgid "非 Tiling 参数或编译参数由用户通过 `hints` 显式给出候选集合；"
msgstr ""
"non-tiling parameters or compilation parameters are provided"
"explicitly by the user through `hints`;"


msgid "autotune 会对两部分组合后的配置空间做评估。"
msgstr "autotune evaluates the combined search space of both parts."


msgid "小结"
msgstr "Summary"


msgid ""
"Triton-Ascend 相比社区 autotune 的关键扩展，不是改变用户接口，而是在社区接口之上增加了“自动生成 Tiling "
"候选并完成寻优”的能力。对大多数用户来说，最推荐的使用方式就是："
msgstr ""
"The key extension of Triton-Ascend over community autotune is not a"
"change in user-facing interfaces, but the addition of automatic"
"tiling-candidate generation and tuning on top of the community"
"interface. For most users, the recommended usage is:"


msgid "保持社区版 `@triton.autotune` 的写法；"
msgstr "keep the community-style `@triton.autotune` interface;"


msgid "将 `configs` 设为 `[]`；"
msgstr "set `configs=[]`;"


msgid "让 Ascend backend 基于 kernel DSL 和运行时 shape 自动完成候选生成、筛选、benchmark 与缓存复用。"
msgstr ""
"let the Ascend backend generate, filter, benchmark, and cache"
"candidate configurations automatically based on the kernel DSL and"
"runtime shapes."


msgid "如果场景不适合自动 Tiling 模式，再回到手写 `triton.Config` 即可。"
msgstr ""
"If your case is not suitable for automatic tiling, you can return to"
"handwritten `triton.Config`."


msgid "社区技术会议"
msgstr "Community Technical Meeting"


msgid ""
"Triton-Ascend "
"定期召开社区技术会议，作为项目治理的核心决策机制。技术方向、大型方案评审、版本发布等重大事项均在技术会议上进行讨论和决策，由所有 "
"`Maintainer` 投票产生。会议对所有社区成员公开，任何人均可参加讨论，但决策和投票仅由 `Maintainer` 完成。"
msgstr ""
"Triton-Ascend holds regular community technical meetings as the core"
"decision-making mechanism for project governance. Major matters such as"
"technical direction, large-scale proposal reviews, and version releases"
"are discussed and decided in technical meetings, with votes cast by all"
"`Maintainers`. Meetings are open to all community members, and anyone"
"can participate in discussions, but decisions and voting are done only"
"by `Maintainers`."


msgid "会议内容"
msgstr "Meeting Content"


msgid "技术方向讨论与决策"
msgstr "Technical direction discussion and decision-making"


msgid "大型方案（RFC）评审与投票"
msgstr "Large-scale proposal (RFC) review and voting"


msgid "版本发布计划与时间线"
msgstr "Version release planning and timeline"


msgid "社区 Issue 和 PR 的优先级排序"
msgstr "Community Issue and PR priority ranking"


msgid "贡献者提名与任免讨论"
msgstr "Contributor nomination and removal discussions"


msgid "会议安排"
msgstr "Meeting Schedule"


msgid "**例会频率**：双周"
msgstr "**Meeting Frequency**: Bi-weekly"


msgid "**会议时间**：周五15:00"
msgstr "**Meeting Time**: Friday 15:00"


msgid "**会议链接**：待公布"
msgstr "**Meeting Link**: To be announced"


msgid "**会议纪要**：待公布"
msgstr "**Meeting Minutes**: To be announced"


msgid "**议题提交**：待公布"
msgstr "**Agenda Submission**: To be announced"


msgid "投票规则"
msgstr "Voting Rules"


