"**Open and Transparent**: All technical decisions and community"
"discussions are conducted through public channels"
"- **Contribution-Oriented**: Membership is based on individual"
"capability and contribution, not tied to employers"
"- **Community-Driven**: Encourage broad participation, respect diverse"
"viewpoints, and reach consensus through discussion and voting"


