msgid "提名可由任何人发起，包括自我提名，以社区issue的方式进行提名"
msgstr "Nominations can be initiated by anyone, including self-nominations, through a community Issue"


msgid "提名时需提供候选人的贡献记录和技术能力说明"
msgstr "Nominations must include the candidate's contribution record and technical capability description"


msgid "现有 Maintainer 审核评估，需**获得当前Maintainer半数及以上同意并无人反对**"
