msgid "Triton-Ascend 调试指南"
msgstr "Triton-Ascend Debugging Guide"


msgid "1 引言"
msgstr "1 Overview"


msgid ""
"本文档为 **Triton-Ascend 调试指南**，面向参与 Triton 与昇腾（Ascend）NPU 适配开发的工程师，系统性地介绍在 "
"Triton-Ascend 编译与运行过程中常用的调试方法与工具。"
msgstr "This document is the **Triton-Ascend Debugging Guide**, which is intended for engineers who participate in adapting Triton to Ascend NPU. It systematically describes the common debugging methods and tools used during Triton-Ascend compilation and running."


msgid "全文内容概览如下："
msgstr "The contents of this document are as follows:"


msgid "章节"
msgstr "Section"


msgid "主要内容"
msgstr "Description"


msgid "**1. 概述**"
msgstr "**1. Overview**"


msgid "说明调试的核心目标（聚焦 `ttir.mlir` → `ttadapter.mlir` 转换），并对常见问题进行分类指引。"
msgstr "Describes the core objectives of debugging (focusing on the `ttir.mlir` to `ttadapter.mlir` conversion) and provides guidance on common issues."


msgid "**2. 编译流程概览**"
msgstr "**2. Compilation Process Overview**"


msgid "介绍 Triton-Ascend 端到端编译链的关键阶段，为后续调试提供上下文基础。"
msgstr "Describes the key phases of the Triton-Ascend end-to-end compilation chain, providing a context basis for subsequent debugging."


msgid "**3. 临时文件指引**"
msgstr "**3. Temporary File Guide**"


msgid "详解编译过程中生成的中间文件（如 `.mlir`、`.ll`、`.o` 等）的存储位置与用途，便于人工检查。"
msgstr "Describes the storage locations and functions of intermediate files (such as the `.mlir`, `.ll`, and `.o` files) generated during the compilation, facilitating manual check."


msgid "**4. 解释器模式**"
msgstr "**4. Interpreter Mode**"


msgid "介绍如何通过 `TRITON_INTERPRET=1` 在 CPU 上运行 kernel，作为 NPU 计算结果的精度基准。"
msgstr "Describes how to set `TRITON_INTERPRET` to `1` to run the kernel on the CPU and use the result as the accuracy benchmark of the NPU computing result."


msgid "**5. 调试方法**"
msgstr "**5. Debugging Methods**"


msgid "提供多种实用调试手段：<br>• 静态/运行时打印<br>• 编译错误调试方法<br>"
msgstr "The following practical debugging methods are provided:<br>Static/Runtime printing<br>Compilation error debugging<br>"


msgid "**附录 A**"
msgstr "**Appendix A**"


msgid "常用环境变量速查表，提升调试效率。"
msgstr "Provides a quick reference table of common environment variables to improve debugging efficiency."


msgid "建议开发者结合具体问题，按需查阅对应章节，以高效定位并解决 Triton-Ascend 集成中的各类异常。"
msgstr "You are advised to refer to the corresponding sections as required to efficiently locate and resolve various exceptions in Triton-Ascend integration."


msgid "1.1 Triton-Ascend 常见问题分类与调试指引"
msgstr "1.1 Triton-Ascend Common Issue Classification and Debugging Guide"


msgid "在开发过程中，问题通常可归纳为以下几类。下表提供了快速的问题类型辨识与首选调试方法指引。"
msgstr "During development, issues can be classified into different types. The following table provides guidance for quickly identifying issue types and preferred debugging methods."


