msgid "通过pip安装Triton-Ascend"
msgstr "Installing Triton-Ascend Using Pip"


msgid "最新稳定版本"
msgstr "Latest Stable Version"


msgid "您可以通过pip安装Triton-Ascend的最新稳定版本。"
msgstr "You can install the latest stable version of Triton-Ascend using pip."


msgid ""
"注意：triton-ascend 3.2.0 及以下 Triton-Ascend和Triton 不能同时存在。需要先卸载社区 Triton，再安装"
" Triton-Ascend。<br> triton-ascend 3.2.1 及以上，Triton-Ascend 通过将 Triton "
"声明为安装依赖来缓解安装覆盖问题。 安装 Triton-Ascend 时会先安装社区 Triton，再由 Triton-Ascend "
"覆盖同名目录，从而避免后续安装其他依赖 Triton 的软件包时再次安装 Triton 而覆盖 Triton-Ascend。 x86 与 arm "
"使用不同版本的社区 Triton 安装包的原因是社区从 3.5 版本开始才提供 arm 版本安装包：x86 依赖 "
"triton==3.2.0，arm 依赖 triton==3.5.0。"
msgstr ""
"Note: Triton-Ascend and Triton cannot coexist in versions 3.2.0 and "
"earlier. You need to uninstall the community Triton first before "
"installing Triton-Ascend.<br> For Triton-Ascend 3.2.1 and later, Triton-"
"Ascend mitigates the installation overwriting issue by declaring Triton "
"as an installation dependency. When installing Triton-Ascend, the "
"community Triton is installed first, and then Triton-Ascend overwrites "
"the directories with the same name. This prevents subsequent "
"installations of other packages that depend on Triton from overwriting "
"Triton-Ascend. The reason x86 and ARM use different community Triton "
"package versions is that the community provides ARM packages starting "
"from version 3.5: x86 depends on triton==3.2.0, and ARM depends on "
"triton==3.5.0."


msgid "历史稳定版本"
msgstr "Historical Stable Versions"


