msgstr "The byte selection parameter s is a 32-bit integer, with each bit group corresponding to byte selection as follows:"


msgid ""
"返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回值 return\\[n] := input\\[selector\\[n]]，n 表示输出整数的第 n "
