msgid "简介：原子性加法操作，在指定的内存位置执行原子加法 原型："
msgstr ""
"Description: Atomic addition operation, performs atomic addition at the "
"specified memory location. Prototype:"


msgid "可以作为tensor的成员函数调用，如`x.atomic_add(...)`，与`atomic_add(x, ...)`等效。"
msgstr ""
"Can be called as a tensor member function, e.g., `x.atomic_add(...)`, "
"equivalent to `atomic_add(x, ...)`."


