msgid "sub_vec_id"
msgstr "sub_vec_id"


msgid "1. 硬件背景"
msgstr "1. Hardware Background"


msgid ""
"昇腾硬件AIC与AIV核数配比不同（1:N），Triton编程抽象屏蔽了Cube核与Vector核的硬件细节，因此，Triton算子开发者无法控制如何切分数据在N个Vector核间并行处理，由编译器通过AutoSubTiling"
" Pass自动实现。"
msgstr ""
"Ascend hardware uses a different core count ratio for AIC and AIV cores"
"(1:N). Triton's programming abstraction hides the hardware details of"
"Cube and Vector cores, so Triton operator developers cannot directly"
"control how data is partitioned across N Vector cores for parallel"
"processing. This is handled automatically by the compiler through the"
"AutoSubTiling pass."


msgid "sub_vec_id编程接口返回N个Vector核的sub id，允许算子开发者根据vector核sub id决定每个核处理哪些数据。"
msgstr ""
"The `sub_vec_id` programming interface returns the sub ID of N Vector"
"cores, allowing operator developers to decide which data each core"
"processes based on the Vector-core sub ID."


msgid "2. 接口说明"
msgstr "2. Interface Description"


msgid "返回值：返回范围为 [0, N) 的 Sub Vector ID，算子开发者可根据该ID决定N个并行Vector核中每个核处理的数据分片"
msgstr ""
"Return value: a Sub Vector ID in the range [0, N). Operator developers"
"can use this ID to decide which data shard each of the N parallel Vector"
"cores should process."


msgid "入参：无"
msgstr "Parameters: none"


msgid "3. 约束说明"
msgstr "3. Constraints"


msgid "仅在AIC和AIV核混合使用场景中有效，不可在纯Cube类算子或者纯Vector类算子中使用，否则会触发编译报错。"
msgstr ""
"This is only valid in scenarios where AIC and AIV cores are used"
"together. It cannot be used in pure Cube operators or pure Vector"
"operators; otherwise, compilation will fail."


msgid "4. 用例示例"
msgstr "4. Example Usage"


msgid "输出："
msgstr "Output:"


msgid "subview"
msgstr "subview"


msgid "1. 硬件背景"
msgstr "1. Hardware Background"


msgid "昇腾硬件 A5 支持了定义新视图，仅通过偏移、大小和步幅实现，不复制底层数据。"
msgstr ""
"Ascend A5 hardware supports defining new views using only offsets,"
"sizes, and strides, without copying the underlying data."


msgid "2. 接口说明"
msgstr "2. Interface Description"


msgid "接口一"
msgstr "Interface 1"


msgid "接口二"
msgstr "Interface 2"


msgid "返回值：bl.buffer"
msgstr "Return value: `bl.buffer`"


msgid "3. 入参说明"
msgstr "3. Parameter Description"


msgid "src: buffer -> 源buffer"
msgstr "`src`: buffer -> source buffer"


msgid "offsets: List[tl.tensor] -> 偏移"
msgstr "`offsets`: `List[tl.tensor]` -> offsets"


msgid "sizes: List[tl.constexpr] -> 输出的size"
msgstr "`sizes`: `List[tl.constexpr]` -> output sizes"


msgid "strides: List[tl.constexpr] -> 步长"
msgstr "`strides`: `List[tl.constexpr]` -> strides"


msgid "4. 约束说明"
msgstr "4. Constraints"


msgid "输入的参数size、offset、stride必须大于0（offset可以是0），不能为负值。"
msgstr ""
"Input parameters `size`, `offset`, and `stride` must be greater than 0"
"(`offset` may be 0) and cannot be negative."


msgid "size的每一个维度的大小不能大于原buffer的大小。"
msgstr ""
"The size of each dimension in `size` cannot exceed the size of the"
"original buffer."


msgid "子视图的每一个维度的大小不能超过原buffer的大小。"
msgstr ""
"The size of each dimension in the subview cannot exceed the size of"
"the original buffer."


msgid "stride的访问不能超过src的大小，stride所有元素全为1。"
msgstr ""
"Stride-based access cannot exceed the size of `src`, and all elements"
"in `stride` must be 1."


msgid "参数的设置要指明每一个维度的值，参数维度应该和输入buffer的维度保持一致。"
msgstr ""
"Parameter settings must specify the value for every dimension, and the"
"parameter dimensions must match those of the input buffer."


msgid "offset必须32字节对齐。"
msgstr "`offset` must be 32-byte aligned."


msgid "子视图中最后一个维度的第二行第一个点的偏移必须是32字节对齐。"
msgstr ""
"In the subview, the offset of the first element in the second row of"
"the last dimension must be 32-byte aligned."


msgid "解释补充：sizes、strides在使用的时候传入类型：List[tl.constexpr]（注意不要误传tensor，否则会报错-类型不匹配）。offsets补充支持了tensor传入（也可以传入constexpr）"
msgstr ""
"Additional explanation: `sizes` and `strides` must be passed as"
"`List[tl.constexpr]` when used. Do not mistakenly pass tensors, or a"
"type-mismatch compilation error will occur. `offsets` additionally"
"supports tensor input (it can also take `constexpr`)."


